# Source code for SlippiOS

SlippiOS is built from <https://github.com/SlippiOS/SlippiOS>.
The release manifest (`manifest.json`) records the exact commit. On a running
system, `/etc/slippios/build` also records the commit.

## Slippi / Dolphin

- Slippi stable 3.6.4 (Ishiiruka):
  <https://github.com/project-slippi/Ishiiruka>
- Slippi beta 4.0.0-mainline-beta.19 (Dolphin):
  <https://github.com/project-slippi/dolphin>
- Slippi playback 3.5.2:
  <https://github.com/project-slippi/Ishiiruka-Playback>

  Verify the corresponding playback source with the Slippi project before
  commercial distribution. The GitHub API currently returns 404 for this
  repository. The stable and beta sources are available.

